{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_750716355#3_1445573933","relevance":1,"reason":"This CNBC article passage is about Nord Stream 2 and why it was controversial because it could increase Europe's dependence on Russia, but it does not explain how Europe solved or reduced its Russian gas problem.","learned":"Nord Stream 2 was opposed by some European countries because it could deepen dependence on Russia and weaken Ukraine’s transit role."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q285","reason":"The current query directly targets the core phrasing of Europe’s dependence on Russian gas; additional results may include more focused articles or policy analyses with concrete solution evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q285"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_750716355#2_1445572211","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q285","rank":2,"snippet":"a primer on the controversial Nord Stream 2 project. What is Nord Stream 2? Nord Stream 2 is a pipeline project slated to transport natural gas from eastern Russia to northern Germany, where it would link up with infrastructure that carries fuel to Western Europe. It would run 1,200 kilometers, mostly under the Baltic Sea along the existing Nord Stream pipeline — hence the name Nord Stream 2. The second line would double the system’s capacity to 110 billion cubic meters. <cover>Russian gas giant Gazprom is building Nord Stream 2. Five European companies, including Royal Dutch Shell and Wintershall, are shouldering half the cost of financing the project. Why is Nord Stream 2 controversial? Some European countries oppose Nord Stream 2, arguing that it increases Europe’s dependence </cover>on Russia and poses threats to their national security.\" , \"start_char\": 1461.000000 , \"title\": \"Behind Nord Stream 2: The Russia-to-Germany gas pipeline that fueled Trump's tirade\" , \"url\": \"https://www.cnbc.com/2018/07/11/behind-nord-stream-2-the-russia-to-germany-gas-pipeline-that-fueled-t.html\" }"}}
